# The provider API hosts the egress proxy allows (CONNECT to port 443
# only), one per line, exact names, no leading dot. Copy this file to
# allowed-hosts on the host and add the line of each provider enabled in
# INTELLIGENCE_CLOUD_PROVIDERS, from intelligence/boundary/cloud/vocab.py
# HOSTS:
#   anthropic  api.anthropic.com
#   openai     api.openai.com
#   xai        api.x.ai
# Listing none (as here) refuses everything. When a provider is switched
# off, remove its line (deploy/README.md, "Cloud models").
